ssage": "v2.3.0 is quarantined (CVE-2026-4417)", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10113, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WwLKGTYLXo9mEBPVaSbywL", "kind": "rejected", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 15037, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TBxEAEdhiU186hXja1cCTP", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19037, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TBxEAEdhiU186hXja1cCTP", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19037, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TBxEAEdhiU186hXja1cCTP", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24479, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016Z6v7qv5kBhZ6mc5Z7t4CS", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.2.9", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. Attempted rollback to v2.3.0 (most recent healthy production release) was rejected because v2.3.0 is quarantined for CVE-2026-4417. Rolled back instead to v2.2.9, the next most recent release that was healthy in production; rollout completed and verified in all three regions. Follow-ups: root-cause the v2.3.1 failure, confirm v2.2.9 is not affected by CVE-2026-4417 and does not reintroduce regressions fixed in v2.3.0, and confirm service health is restored.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 25079, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016Z6v7qv5kBhZ6mc5Z7t4CS", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 25079, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016Z6v7qv5kBhZ6mc5Z7t4CS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 31680, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Findings**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history: v2.2.9 (healthy, prod) \u2192 v2.3.0 (healthy, prod) \u2192 v2.3.1-rc (unhealthy, staging only) \u2192 v2.3.1 (unhealthy, prod).\n\n**Actions**\n1. **Attempted rollback to v2.3.0** (the most recent healthy production release) \u2014 rejected by the system because v2.3.0 is quarantined for **CVE-2026-4417**. Nothing was changed by this attempt.\n2. **Rolled back to v2.2.9** \u2014 the next most recent release that was healthy in production. Rollout completed and verified in all three regions.\n3. **Opened SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api (on-call paged), documenting the failure, the blocked v2.3.0 attempt, the v2.2.9 rollback, and follow-ups.\n\n**Things to note for follow-up**\n- The service is now two releases back (v2.2.9), so any fixes or features shipped in v2.3.0 are temporarily absent.\n- Someone should confirm v2.2.9 isn't itself affected by CVE-2026-4417 (the quarantine was only flagged on v2.3.0), and verify checkout-api's health/error rate has recovered after the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu